OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,FThe family of a 61-year-old woman who
OL,8,Fdied following an incident in Carlisle
OL,9,Fhave paid tribute to her.
OL,11,FSusan Watson was found dead at a
OL,12,Fproperty on Whinlatter Way on Sunday 2
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FA man in his 60s was arrested in
OL,16,Fconnection with the investigation, but
OL,17,Fhas since been released on bail while
OL,18,Fenquiries continue.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
