CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,FDetectives are working to establish
OL,8,Fthe full circumstances surrounding the
OL,9,Fwoman's death and enquiries remain
OL,10,Fongoing.
OL,12,FThe family of Susan has since paid
OL,13,Ftribute to her life.
OL,15,FThe family said: "Susan Watson was a
OL,16,Fmuch-loved sister, Mam, Grandma and
OL,17,Ffriend. Family meant everything to
OL,18,Fher, and she was never happier than
OL,19,Fwhen she had the people she loved
OL,20,Faround her.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"She absolutely adored being a Grandma
OL,8,Fand treasured every moment she spent
OL,9,Fwith her grandchildren.
OL,11,F"Helping people was simply who Susan
OL,12,Fwas. She always put other people
OL,13,Fbefore herself and was the first to
OL,14,Foffer a helping hand, whether it was
OL,15,Ffamily, friends, neighbours or
OL,16,Fcomplete strangers.
OL,18,F"She never expected anything in return
OL,19,Fand never wanted recognition. She just
OL,20,Fbelieved that if someone needed help,
OL,21,Fyou helped them.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"Susan gave many years of her time to
OL,8,Fvolunteering with the Samaritans. She
OL,9,Fspent countless evenings at Carlisle
OL,10,Frailway station, whatever the weather,
OL,11,Foffering a listening ear to anyone who
OL,12,Fneeded someone to talk to.
OL,14,F"She also volunteered in the
OL,15,FSamaritans charity shop, supporting
OL,16,Fpeople in any way she could.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"As a foot practitioner in Carlisle,
OL,8,FSusan built lasting friendships with
OL,9,Fso many of her patients. She often
OL,10,Fwent far beyond what anyone would
OL,11,Fexpect, picking up shopping for people
OL,12,Fwho couldn't get out, checking in on
OL,13,Fthose who were struggling, and making
OL,14,Fsure nobody felt alone or forgotten.
OL,16,F"To many people, she became much more
OL,17,Fthan their foot practitioner.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"Her kindness didn't stop there. Susan
OL,8,Fhad a way of making everyone feel
OL,9,Fwelcome. If someone had nowhere to go
OL,10,Fat Christmas, there was always a place
OL,11,Fat her table.
OL,13,F"If someone was going through a
OL,14,Fdifficult time, she would open her
OL,15,Fhome and do whatever she could to
OL,16,Fhelp. Looking after other people came
OL,17,Fnaturally to her.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"Susan leaves behind a family who
OL,8,Floved her beyond words, along with so
OL,9,Fmany friends, neighbours, patients and
OL,10,Fcolleagues whose lives are better for
OL,11,Fhaving known her.
OL,13,F"We will remember Susan for her
OL,14,Fkindness, her generosity and the
OL,15,Fdifference she made to so many
OL,16,Fpeople's lives.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786029507
OL,3,C'Heartbroken' family pays tribute to
OL,4,Cwoman who died after incident in
OL,5,CCarlisle
OL,7,F"We are heartbroken by her loss and
OL,8,Fkindly ask that our family's privacy
OL,9,Fis respected as we come to terms with
OL,10,Fwhat has happened. We would also like
OL,11,Fto thank everyone for the kindness,
OL,12,Fsupport and compassion that has been
OL,13,Fshown to us during this incredibly
OL,14,Fdifficult time."
OL,16,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,17,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,18,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,19,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,20,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,21,Fbelow...
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/8
